You have a TON of options.

1) Use your magic marker to write a spellbook of jumping.  Medusa
level can always be solved by jumping.
2) Use your polymorph control to polymorph into a flying monster -
e.g. vampire lord, and fly across.
3) Dig or levelport past it, and come up from underneath (be sure you
have your blindfold on). Remember not to dig adjacent to any water
squares.
4) Sacrifice and pray for more spellbooks.  Learn the levitation
spell.
5) Learn the cone of cold spell. Freeze your way across the level.
6) Get a saddle, tame a dragon, and ride across.

There are MANY more ways.

BTW - relearn the following spells.  They are important.
charm monster, detect monsters, cure sickness, extra healing,slow
monster, and sleep

Learn the following spells.  They really kick ass.
jumping, haste self, magic mapping. cone of cold, fireball, drain life

You can get all unknown spellbooks by sacrificing until you can pray
successfully, then praying (on a co-aligned altar). Any co-aligned
altar combined with the spell of create monster and the Eye of the
Aethiopica adds up to a complete spell list.  You could also polypile
the spellbooks you don't plan on re-reading, if you are impatient.

Be sure to magic missile those eels before they can get close to you. 
Engrave Elbereth on your square if any get adjacent to you.  Getting
insta-killed now would really suck.  Grease your cloak if you can.

